  "description": "`Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Providers.HidSharp` is a backend provider for [Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Abstractions](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Abstractions)\nthat utilizes the [HIDSharp](https://github.com/SeekHisKingdom/HIDSharp/) library for hardware communication.\nIt enables applications using the `Smdn.IO.UsbHid.*` abstraction layer to operate on HID devices through the `HidSharp` implementation.",
